      "difficulty": "advanced",
      "letter": "Dear Mr Tom,\n\nOur village is famous for its pottery, and the skills have been passed down from my grandparents. Lately, though, we have run out of good clay, and fewer tourists come to look around the craft village.\n\nI don't know where to find new clay or how to bring visitors back. Could you call a meeting so that the whole community can share ideas?\n\nBest regards,\nBen",
